      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability — splitting the monolithic method into focused test methods with `@DisplayName` annotations and assertion messages.Now let me compile-check the generated test.The test compiled successfully. The warnings are expected (they match the original's intentional uncast `null` call) and do not affect correctness.\n\nThe improved test preserves all original assertions in `testGetInstance()` while adding a `@Nested` class structure that groups the nine cases into two logical categories — null/empty inputs and well-known pattern cache hits — each with `@DisplayName` and per-assertion messages explaining the intent."
